Those raw LICENSE/COPYING URLs returned 404 at vendoring time.

The vendored `core.py` is retained for attribution and reproducibility because
Wayffusion needs to call the real OpenAI MPE `World.step()` implementation.
Before redistributing Wayffusion externally, verify the upstream licensing
status and replace this notice with the correct upstream license if one becomes
available.
